WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:03,340
Can the second-hand cars you mentioned before still be used?

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:05,680
Boss Jin can rest assured

3
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:09,570
Okay, I'll leave the tens of millions of orders to you.

4
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:11,830
Boss Jin, I respect you

5
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:19,820
Next time you have this kind of shrimp, remember to save some for me.

6
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:28,390
So, the little boss, why can’t I buy things at a discount?

7
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:32,580
You are the little boss and I am still the big boss.

8
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:34,200
Say one hundred means one hundred

9
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,700
Have you ever seen someone bargaining with the store owner when buying something at a convenience store?

10
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:40,200
I will have to save this little money temporarily from now on.
